# The upstream names a Zen page does not tell Zen's story with. Read by
# scripts/check-zen.ts, which runs in pre-build and fails the build on a hit.
#
# One name per line; `#` starts a comment. Case is ignored and a name matches as
# a whole word — no letter directly before or after it — so `Qwen` also catches
# Qwen3, Qwen3.5, qwen4exp and Qwen3_5ForConditionalGeneration.
#
# A Zen page says these names in two places only, and marks both `data-upstream`:
# the Architecture value (the loader string from the weights' own config, which a
# developer has to pass verbatim) and the License & attribution section at the
# bottom. Everything else on the page — title, description, headings, prose,
# tables, code, alt text — says Zen.
#
# The list starts from the base models the zenlm cards on Hugging Face declare
# (`base_model`), by the name a reader would meet them under. A new one goes
# here, and nowhere else.
Qwen
QwenLM
Flash-Next
Nemotron
Bonsai
DeepSeek
MiniMax
FLUX
Wan
TRELLIS
YuE
Granite
SSD-1B
